  "referencedFlows": [ "bell_Query_Rewriter" ],
  "instruction": {
    "steps": [ {
      "text": "CRITICAL RULES — ENFORCE AT ALL TIMES:\r\n  - DO NOT respond to the user under ANY circumstance. This playbook is completely silent.\r\n  - DO NOT ask the user for any information.\r\n  - DO NOT engage in any conversation with the user.\r\n  - DO NOT detect intent or set a route. The route is already provided as input.\r\n  - YOUR ONLY JOB is to immediately call the extract_entities tool and transition. Nothing else.\r\n  - Any response to the user is a FAILURE of this playbook.\r\n\r\n- Get the utterance from the `utterance` parameter.\r\n- Get the route from the `route` parameter.\r\n- Get the language from the `language` parameter. If null or empty, detect from utterance: set to \"en\" if English, \"fr-ca\" if French.\r\n\r\n- Step 1: Entity Extraction Tool Invocation:\r\n    - IMMEDIATELY CALL `extract_entities` with `utterance`, `route`, and `language` parameters. These three parameters are essential so don't forget to include them.\r\n    - DO NOT wait for user input. DO NOT ask the user anything. Call the tool immediately.\r\n    - DO NOT produce any text response before or after calling the tool.\r\n        - The flow required for valid transition is: ${FLOW:bell_Query_Rewriter}\r\n    - **EXAMPLES (STRICTLY FOLLOW THIS PATTERN):**\r\n    - **Example 1 (Successful Extraction):**\r\n        - Input: utterance=\"my phone was stolen I want to suspend my service\", route=\"account_suspend_service\", language=\"en\"\r\n        - Tool Call: `extract_entities` with arguments `utterance`=\"my phone was stolen I want to suspend my service\", `route`=\"account_suspend_service\", `language`=\"en\"\r\n        - Tool `extract_entities` output: (Leave all parameters empty. The tool execution is the final action.)\r\n        - Action: `extract_entities` will call ${FLOW:bell_Query_Rewriter} via `add_override`\r\n    - **Example 2 (Successful Extraction):**\r\n        - Input: utterance=\"I want to get an eSIM for my account\", route=\"equipment_request_sim\", language=\"en\"\r\n        - Tool Call: `extract_entities` with arguments `utterance`=\"I want to get an eSIM for my account\", `route`=\"equipment_request_sim\", `language`=\"en\"\r\n        - Tool `extract_entities` output: (Leave all parameters empty. The tool execution is the final action.)\r\n        - Action: `extract_entities` will call ${FLOW:bell_Query_Rewriter} via `add_override`\r\n    - **Example 3 (No entities found):**\r\n        - Input: utterance=\"I need help with my bill\", route=\"bill_vague\", language=\"en\"\r\n        - Tool Call: `extract_entities` with arguments `utterance`=\"I need help with my bill\", `route`=\"bill_vague\", `language`=\"en\"\r\n        - Tool `extract_entities` output: (Leave all parameters empty. The tool execution is the final action.)\r\n        - Action: `extract_entities` will call ${FLOW:bell_Query_Rewriter} via `add_override`\r\n    - **Example 4 (French - Successful Extraction):**\r\n        - Input: utterance=\"je veux mettre à jour mon iPhone\", route=\"equipment_upgrade_device\", language=\"fr-ca\"\r\n        - Tool Call: `extract_entities` with arguments `utterance`=\"je veux mettre à jour mon iPhone\", `route`=\"equipment_upgrade_device\", `language`=\"fr-ca\"\r\n        - Tool `extract_entities` output: (Leave all parameters empty. The tool execution is the final action.)\r\n        - Action: `extract_entities` will call ${FLOW:bell_Query_Rewriter} via `add_override`"
    } ]
  },
  "playbookType": "TASK",
  "codeBlock": {
    "code": "@Action\r\ndef extract_entities(utterance: str, route: str, language: str) -\u003e str:\r\n\r\n    try:\r\n        parameters = {}\r\n\r\n        matches = flows.bell_Query_Rewriter.match_intent(utterance).matches\r\n\r\n        if matches and matches[0].parameters:\r\n            for entity, value in matches[0].parameters.items():\r\n                if value:\r\n                    parameters[entity] = value\r\n\r\n        parameters[\"route\"]     = route\r\n        parameters[\"language\"]  = language\r\n        parameters[\"utterance\"] = utterance\r\n\r\n        add_override(flows.bell_Query_Rewriter, parameters)\r\n\r\n    except Exception as e:\r\n        print(f\"[extract_entities] Error: {e}\")\r\n        add_override(flows.bell_Query_Rewriter, {\r\n            \"route\":     route,\r\n            \"language\":  language,\r\n            \"utterance\": utterance\r\n        })"
  },
  "inlineActions": [ "extract_entities" ]
}
